WEBVTT

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:00.856
(Laughter)

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:03.536
And the third reason
that he would tell you no,

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:04.776
he doesn't like you.

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:06.016
He doesn't like you.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.176
(Laughter)

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:09.496
And that's something that could happen.

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:13.816
But even that will be
valuable information for you

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:17.896
that will help to inform
your next conversation with a sponsor

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:21.360
that might make it
a little bit more impactful.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.656
I cannot tell you how important
it is to have a sponsor.

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:29.976
It is the critical relationship
in your career.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.856
A mentor, frankly, is a nice to have,